              <run fontcolor='#6b6b66' fontname='Tableau Book' fontsize='9'>37 incidents raised over deliberately small demo slices, so every rate here is a rate over a sample chosen to be small; the response times are real measurements of real delays. Source: the n8n incident status API, refreshed by tableau/build_extracts.py. Repository: github.com/sergey-kasatov/arkon-manufacturing-ai</run>
